<div id="q-dm-responsible" class="question">
  <h3>12. What methods or software tools are needed to access and use data?</h3>

  <div class="answer">
    {%- if data.dmp.areSpecialToolsRequired._value is sameas true -%}
        <p>In our {{ globals.projects}} there are special tools required to access and use the data.</p>
        {%- if data.dmp.sharedResources.tools|length > 0 -%}
            <ul>
            {%- for tool in data.dmp.sharedResources.tools -%}
                <li style="margin-bottom: 2em;">

                <strong>{{ tool.name._value if tool.name and tool.name._value else "(no name given)" }}</strong>{{ macros.linkQuestion(tool.name._path) }}
                <br>{{tool.description._value|markdown if tool.description and tool.description._value else "(no description given)"}}{{ macros.linkQuestion(tool.description._path) }}<br>
                {%- if tool.isFreeAndAvailable and tool.isFreeAndAvailable._value is sameas true %}
                    This tool is free and available for use.{{ macros.linkQuestion(tool.isFreeAndAvailable._path) }}
                {%- elif tool.isFreeAndAvailable and tool.isFreeAndAvailable._value is sameas false %}
                    This tool is not free and available for use.{{ macros.linkQuestion(tool.isFreeAndAvailable._path) }}
                    {%- if tool.noAvailableSolution %}
                        However, there is an alternative solution that allows omitting this tool: {{tool.noAvailableSolution._value}}.{{ macros.linkQuestion(tool.noAvailableSolution._path) }}
                    {%- endif -%}
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if tool.hasAccessLink and tool.hasAccessLink._value is sameas true and tool.identifier -%}
                    <p>This tool can be accessed directly at {{ macros.formatIdentifier(tool.identifier) }}.</p>
                {%- elif tool.hasAccessLink and tool.hasAccessLink._value is sameas false %}
                    This tool cannot be accessed directly, but it can be obtained through other means.{{ macros.linkQuestion(tool.hasAccessLink._path) }}
                    {%- if tool.noAccessLinkAlternatives.includesDocumentation and tool.noAccessLinkAlternatives.includesDocumentation._value is sameas true %}
                        The documentation of this software will be included in the metadata of data set.{{ macros.linkQuestion(tool.noAccessLinkAlternatives.includesDocumentation._path) }}
                    {%- elif tool.noAccessLinkAlternatives.includesDocumentation and tool.noAccessLinkAlternatives.includesDocumentation._value is sameas false %}
                        The documentation of this software will not be included in the metadata of the data set{{" because: " ~ tool.noAccessLinkAlternatives.noDocumentationReason._value if tool.noAccessLinkAlternatives.noDocumentationReason }}.{{ macros.linkQuestion(tool.noAccessLinkAlternatives.includesDocumentation._path) }}
                    {%- endif -%}
                    {%- if tool.noAccessLinkAlternatives.includesSoftware and tool.noAccessLinkAlternatives.includesSoftware._value is sameas true %}
                        The software (e.g. in open source code) will be included.{{ macros.linkQuestion(tool.noAccessLinkAlternatives.includesSoftware._path) }}
                    {%- elif tool.noAccessLinkAlternatives.includesSoftware and tool.noAccessLinkAlternatives.includesSoftware._value is sameas false %}
                        The software (e.g. in open source code) will not be included.{{ macros.linkQuestion(tool.noAccessLinkAlternatives.includesSoftware._path) }}
                    {%- endif -%}
                {%- endif -%}
                </li>
            {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>
        {%- else -%}
            <p>No specific tools has been defined.</p>
        {%- endif -%}
    {%- elif data.dmp.areSpecialToolsRequired._value is sameas false -%}
        <p>In our {{ globals.projects}} there are no special tools required to access and use the data{%- if data.dmp.noSpecialToolsReason -%}, because: {{ data.dmp.noSpecialToolsReason._value }}{{ macros.linkQuestion(data.dmp.noSpecialToolsReason._path) }}{%- else -%}{{ macros.linkQuestion(data.dmp.areSpecialToolsRequired._path) }}{% endif -%}.</p>
    {%- else -%}
        <p>It is not specified whether special tools are required to access and use the data in our {{ globals.projects}}.</p>
    {%- endif -%}
    <p>Details on the handling of access requests are provided in Section 4, Question 8.</p>
    </div>
</div>
